  "question": {
    "text": "The integral value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> for which the quadratic equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has both the roots&nbsp;negative is given by",
